  = note: SCXML 1.0 §6.4: a finished invoked service "MUST return a special event 'done.invoke.id' to the external event queue of the invoking process, where id is the invokeid for this invocation"; every build bounds an event name to 1,024 bytes of UTF-8, so this invocation could never report that it finished; SCXML 1.0 sets no length, and this is the implementation's bound (spec errata L.6)
  = help: shorten the ID to at most 1,012 bytes
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §6.4 <invoke>

